# Editable world plan. Bays are 7x7 map units; grid coordinates start at 0.
# Repeated room IDs join bays into one room. Door offsets are 0-based from the bay edge.
# Doorway format: door <room-ID> <room-ID> <offset> [width]. Offsets are 0-based; width defaults to 1 map unit.
# Exit format: exit <north|east|south|west> <room-ID>. The exit is centered on that room's exterior wall.
# Wall picture format: picture <cat|dog> <bay-col> <bay-row> <side> <offset> <bottom-z> <width> <height>.
# Magic door format: magicdoor <side> <room-ID> <pair-ID>.

